      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T15:24:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should be able to assert that this pipeline does not use immutable samplers in this case. When the combined texture-and-sampler count is 2 and it uses a texture copy, the only texture-sampler will be the dstCopy intrinsic and that should always be using a nearest-neighbor sampler.",
