      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T15:27:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, that makes sense. So theoretically we should never encounter this case when using an immutable sampler, meaning this CL would not fix the bug we are seeing unless something else is going awry? \n\nIf that is the case I can change this to an assert. Leaving as-is for now for experimentation.",
